                        "glosses": [
                            "A manifesto or formal public declaration, originally political; a proclamation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a6cdfbc-9b9a-40e0-8bcb-f49ff90852c4",
                                "sense_id": "a1064790-309f-305c-ba8a-3dafad60542e",
                                "text": "I think of Spengler and of his terrible pronunciamentos, and I wonder if style, style in the grand manner, is done for."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5027a1c3-5615-495e-a1d2-b7c39034c5ab",
                                "sense_id": "a1064790-309f-305c-ba8a-3dafad60542e",
                                "text": "After assembling an army in Catalonia, he marched on Madrid, issuing en route a pronunciamento calling on the Queen Regent to banish Valenzuela and to accept him as her first minister."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81528825-baf5-3f5d-ab9c-0026bfd07e20",
                        "entry_id": "9c003bfb-56ff-395a-b0a1-4c24ec57a758",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In Mexico and Latin America, an uprising or insurrection."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
